k" href="https://baike.baidu.com/reference/22873439/533aYdO6cr3_z3kATPXYzq72NHzBZ9T47bzXB-FzzqIP0XOpX5nyFIs66dk-sPRoGUXIvtdlddkEn-atFUlF7_8NceQqQ7A9zimhF2acjdHg_NAykthMo5QbHPA" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/reference/22873439/533aYdO6cr3_z3kATPXYzq72NHzBZ9T47bzXB-FzzqIP0XOpX5nyFIs66dk-sPRoGUXIvtdlddkEn-atFUlF7_8NceQqQ7A9zimhF2acjdHg_NAykthMo5QbHPA"><span>“青岛城阳灭门案”四被告人一审获死刑 律师这么说</span></a><span>．中国网．2018-09-15</span></p><p><a class="hk-link-mark hk-link" href="https://baike.baidu.com/reference/22873439/533aYdO6cr3_z3kATPDZzP71On2RPt6ku-GBW-dzzqIPmGapB4OrUok799Y28PJzWgjF_5VrZNIZk6f5D09E7v8Tbu81Q7I9nHf-VSyRluCiqod19dJFoo1KUKsR6PDv7gChjg" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/reference/22873439/533aYdO6cr3_z3kATPDZzP71On2RPt6ku-GBW-dzzqIPmGapB4OrUok799Y28PJzWgjF_5VrZNIZk6f5D09E7v8Tbu81Q7I9nHf-VSyRluCiqod19dJFoo1KUKsR6PDv7gChjg"><span>青岛城阳发生"灭门案" 4名嫌疑人被抓获</span></a><span>．人民日报．2017-11-16</span></p>]]></description>
