  <item>
    <title>EP65. 82年的金智英：韩国仁川干尸案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a81c1b836641f136d8915da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a81c1b836641f136d8915da</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 14:01:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZnbdK7tY3WJe10Opz9zTGX8a6j.jpg"><p><strong><span>导言</span></strong></p><p><span>今天我们要讲的这个故事，发生在韩国仁川广域市。时间离我们很近——2024年7月的一天，一具尘封了三年半的女性干尸，在一间仅13平米的出租屋里被发现。尸体皮肤完好，呈大字型躺在被褥下，房间开着空调和风扇，空气中弥漫着漂白剂的气味。</span></p><p><span>而租下这间屋子的男人，已经因诈骗罪入狱。他叫金某，时年38岁。警方找到他时，他才慢吞吞地承认——那是他的前女友，被他杀死后，藏尸在此。而他本人，在尸体旁边吃饭、看电视、自拍，甚至对着干尸搞网恋、结婚、生子，一直持续了1277天。</span></p><p><span>这不是恐怖电影。这是韩国SBS《我想知道真相》节目披露的真实案件。一个男人如何把活生生的恋人变成一具干尸？又为何能若无其事地过上全新的人生？今天，我们将从这间13平米的ROOM 101开始，一步一步拆开这个细思极恐的故事。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUBmYVjSmSRXyxmqzqb8baO9pdI.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs1ODbrmqYQYW9O-cM5APxSe1OE0.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvgvgff6QLjwCSk4eqyTT4BluXWj.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhHbDZHJy7dEm2wX6mVPooXebzHg.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FheDQruDErMpzvEHPB-eftOdtbEq.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh9Ydfl6Y5GO0UlJJakSGGPGfO3l.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJl0_7Opo6-exVrwo6VIKZ9Ian2.png"><p><span>参考资料</span></p><p><span>chosunbiz《Man in Incheon hides partner's body for 3.5 years, sentenced to 27 years》</span></p><p><span>SBS《</span><a class="zReHs" href="https://m.news.sbs.co.kr/english/article.do?newsId=N1008671969" data-url="https://m.news.sbs.co.kr/english/article.do?newsId=N1008671969"><u><span>Man Sentenced to 27 Years in Prison for Murdering Friend ...</span></u></a><u><span>》</span></u><br><span>Korean Herald &lt;</span><a class="zReHs" href="https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10642555" data-url="https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10642555"><u><span>Man killed girlfriend after fight, kept studio and used air ...</span></u></a><u><span>&gt;</span></u></p><p><span>Seoul Economic Daily &lt;</span><a class="zReHs" href="https://en.sedaily.com/society/2025/12/24/man-who-hid-murder-victims-body-for-35-years-appeals-27" data-url="https://en.sedaily.com/society/2025/12/24/man-who-hid-murder-victims-body-for-35-years-appeals-27"><u><span>Man Who Hid Murder Victim's Body for 3.5 Years Appeals ...</span></u></a><u><span>&gt;</span></u></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
