  <item>
    <title>EP64. 名为爱情的控制：湖南郴州砌墙藏尸案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a789578c4079d62c57fc7b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a789578c4079d62c57fc7b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 15:01:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpqmYkFVugI-KuPsdfLZBIkjHPlL.jpg"><p><span>导言</span></p><p><span>2010年7月，一个24岁的外科医生消失了。监控显示他走进了一家宾馆，再也没有出来。一个文文弱弱的女药剂师，拖着两个红色行李箱走出了那间房——箱子里，装着她曾经深爱的人，被分解成了两块。</span></p><p><span>有人说这是因爱生恨的极端样本，有人说是扭曲占有欲的必然结局。而我梳理完所有的卷宗、报道和庭审记录之后，最让我脊背发凉的是：凶手的脸上，从始至终都没有出现过恐惧或悔恨的表情。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVnjib1HgIxEpqtzp8B-LglwJ0w.png"><p><span>刘军和胡芳</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiOFg13CtFqGGsSQe1ux6Dbblm1C.png"><p><span>胡芳在广西医科大学门口</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmh79BUt1rQ-kbDHFK_mBwkvLj_M.png"><p><span>警方查看监控</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FryzjDP_c1G8rqip4Qwdlhr_4SpY.png"><p><span>红色行李箱</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqtbsZR98EziEVjnUuQSGwnCKT3J.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkSXxZMByFndo_FahmFJ1AP-rGW_.png"><p><span>崩溃的刘军母亲</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgoH4DNAA7y0CmHuAoGBvna0m8Te.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2XaTlZ4dkmOAykNarji6LkPWJA.png"><p><span>情绪激动的刘家人</span></p><p></p><p><span>参考资料</span></p><p><span>华声在线-三湘都市报《郴州一女药师因爱生恨 药翻男友将其残忍碎尸》</span></p><p><span>陕西法制网《</span><strong><span>湖南郴州女医师杀人碎尸案侦破纪实》</span></strong></p><p><a class="refLink_tL5RX" href="https://baike.baidu.com/reference/17508865/533aYdO6cr3_z3kATPyMzvijZCvCMY_5ueHRALpzzqIP0XOpSZ71FJAm79tx_fkoGUXbuIg9adJIxLzyD0hF" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/reference/17508865/533aYdO6cr3_z3kATPyMzvijZCvCMY_5ueHRALpzzqIP0XOpSZ71FJAm79tx_fkoGUXbuIg9adJIxLzyD0hF"><span>郴州女药师下药毒杀医生男友被执行枪决</span></a><span>．湘潭在线网</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68036338b4d889035f95671a/lrLbNPq0kJxEv9NExQwXuLvop4vR.m4a" length="43409214" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:44</itunes:duration>
