  <item>
    <title>EP62. 凝固的罪证：浙江东阳水泥藏尸案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5cf25f6356eb2d9be5161d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5cf25f6356eb2d9be5161d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 16:29:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnh5BMo-E_aDP_xJ9c_bm8dV9DWy.jpg"><p><span>导言</span></p><p><span>东阳这个地方，如果你不太熟悉的话，我说横店你可能就知道了。对，就是那个到处都是剧组、满街跑明星的横店影视城，行政区划上就属于东阳。那个地方每年拍几百部戏，造梦、造星、也造各种各样的故事。但2013年的夏天，在那个地方发生了一件事，比任何一部犯罪片都更让人头皮发麻。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoXngdUdkJxqb7--LUJOg-wf63Hr.jpg"><p><span>马小英发来的短信</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpFMKL6xJgoNZZhTH3dWD1q3CWTa.jpg"><p><span>普通的地下室窗户</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZLZ2RfTtTHAg7WDWvIosfCQe5v.jpg"><p><span>马小红家被封住的窗户</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvJFjx6Rx2XPyVEvqCLE92v7lcGw.jpg"><p><span>喷溅状血迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkk1fFrLExqLBxrFcGckuUR6n5vG.jpg"><p><span>水泥墩</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoByNlxdQVmEjLauJO4U9_nIHaNp.jpg"><p><span>租房合同</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFLHkrdI4_2OhJydY3wawuA0vdn.jpg"><p><span>张海军在银行取钱的画面</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqBKaK3MLb6NiBqkfMThW5GMYGOR.jpg"><p><span>张海军的老家</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujUxxkYOWA1V9GmrIYintWK3joK.jpg"><p><span>长途汽车内部cctv画面拍到的张海军</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4kHxTaSg1Vie5PlgBlOdax-adb.jpg"><p><span>抓捕现场</span></p><p><span>参考资料</span></p><p><span>CCTV天网节目《凝固的罪证》</span></p>]]></description>
